WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:05.071
- It is so good to see you,
Keith.

00:00:05.104 --> 00:00:07.507
- Yeah, we usually have to
wait for a special occasion.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.075
- Actually, I have a little
surprise.

00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:11.110
I got engaged.

00:00:11.143 --> 00:00:13.513
- Oh. (laughs)
- Oh. (laughs)

00:00:16.615 --> 00:00:17.484
- Son.

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:26.292
- (claps) Whoo-hoo, yes, wow.

00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:29.763
Congratulations, little bro.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:34.734
Engaged, kind of a big deal.

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:37.170
More for me, I guess,
that's what that means.

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:41.541
- She got a name?

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:42.342
- Stephanie.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:45.378
- Marriage is a wonderful
journey.

00:00:45.411 --> 00:00:47.247
- 50% end in divorce.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:51.818
Sorry bro, them's just the
facts.

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:55.555
- I will keep that in mind,
thank you.

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:56.689
- You got a photo?

00:00:56.722 --> 00:00:57.557
- Oh yeah.

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.826
- AKA does she exist?

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:00.693
- There you go.

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:04.197
- (whistles) Mm, ha-ha.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:10.070
- (gasps) Oh, she's beautiful.

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:13.372
- Let me get eyes on this.

00:01:13.405 --> 00:01:14.774
Everybody else already has.

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:19.646
Great lighting.

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:22.515
Airbrush?

00:01:22.548 --> 00:01:23.382
- No.

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.118
- She kinda looks like that one
model

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:26.686
on The Price is Right.

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:30.223
- Yes, that's her.

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:31.624
- The Price is Right?

00:01:31.657 --> 00:01:33.493
Clive, that's your show.

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:34.727
- Shut up, Ma.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:35.829
No it's not.

00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:41.167
Oh yeah, Stephanie.

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:44.804
People always underbid on her
showcases.

00:01:44.837 --> 00:01:46.473
Not the best presenter.

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:50.409
- Where's the wedding?

00:01:50.442 --> 00:01:51.878
- In Hawaii.

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:52.912
- Ooh.

00:01:52.945 --> 00:01:54.814
- Oh-ho-ho, whoa. (claps)

00:01:56.515 --> 00:01:58.785
Awesome, hoo-hoo, (speaks
in foreign language).

00:02:04.623 --> 00:02:06.292
She ever been married before?

00:02:06.325 --> 00:02:07.160
- No.

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:08.327
- So she says.

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:09.762
Ex-boyfriend, she got one?

00:02:09.795 --> 00:02:10.663
- Of course.

00:02:10.696 --> 00:02:14.234
- Sloppy seconds, at least,
right Dad?

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:19.338
- Keith, she sounds wonderful.

00:02:19.371 --> 00:02:20.206
- Thank you Mom.

00:02:20.239 --> 00:02:22.575
- Shut up, Ma.

00:02:22.608 --> 00:02:24.844
Silence from you.

00:02:24.877 --> 00:02:27.714
You're cut off from talking.

00:02:30.249 --> 00:02:31.817
- You know what, Clive?

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:33.252
I really don't appreciate

00:02:33.285 --> 00:02:34.888
the way that you're talking to
Mom.

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:40.193
(Clive claps and laughs)

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:42.695
- Yes, yes.

00:02:42.728 --> 00:02:45.898
The prodigal son has returned.

00:02:45.931 --> 00:02:47.200
You know what?

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:48.701
You want to go, let's go.

00:02:48.734 --> 00:02:51.437
Because I've been here
for the last 15 years

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:52.872
taking care of Mom and Dad

00:02:52.905 --> 00:02:55.441
while you've been trollopsing
all over the world

00:02:55.474 --> 00:02:56.342
and why?

00:02:56.375 --> 00:02:58.578
So you can come back here,
criticize me

00:02:58.611 --> 00:02:59.812
for how I treat them?

00:02:59.845 --> 00:03:02.381
- No, I actually came here

00:03:02.414 --> 00:03:05.284
to ask you if you would do me
the honor

00:03:05.317 --> 00:03:06.586
of being my Best Man.

00:03:13.425 --> 00:03:16.429
I know that we have had our
differences,

00:03:17.296 --> 00:03:18.565
but you're my older brother.

00:03:22.334 --> 00:03:24.237
We'll pay for your room,

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:26.572
and we're also gonna rent you a
car.

00:03:26.605 --> 00:03:28.408
And we'll pay to fly you out
there.

00:03:33.579 --> 00:03:34.447
- First class?

00:03:35.614 --> 00:03:36.983
- Well, we can't afford first
class.

00:03:37.016 --> 00:03:39.585
- Well, (bleep) you.

00:03:39.618 --> 00:03:40.520
You're dead to me.

00:03:42.454 --> 00:03:43.289
- Why?

00:03:43.322 --> 00:03:43.956
- Shut up, Ma.

00:03:43.989 --> 00:03:45.291
I'm eating in my room.

00:03:52.865 --> 00:03:54.834
- Well, that went better than
expected.

00:03:56.001 --> 00:03:56.902
- I think so.

00:03:56.935 --> 00:03:57.804
- Yeah.

